# claude
# Default to ignoring everything inside .claude/ so local per-session
# state (sessions/, settings.local.json, statsig/, etc.) doesn't leak
# into the repo. The pattern matches contents rather than the dir
# itself (`.claude/**`, not `.claude/`) so the `!` exceptions below
# can re-include the project-level config that every session should
# see: settings.json, the hooks/ tree, and the skills/ tree (vendored
# Venice API skills that Claude Code auto-discovers from the repo).
# Git's rule is that an excluded *directory* can't have its contents
# re-included, so the `**` form is load-bearing here.
.claude/**
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/hooks/**
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
.mcp.json

# opencode
opencode.json
AGENTS.local.md

